                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9f8f7b34-facf-4ca7-bd10-d3b82ebcd68c",
                        "source_entry_id": "de350c9b-4a49-3a1d-b305-ba581155aeca",
                        "source_sense_id": "f53d6f4c-4d41-3815-b7fa-95cfb0d3cc07",
                        "target_lang_word": "someway",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "someway",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b860af1-3eab-3d2b-9aa5-79b60c2194ce",
                                        "entry_id": "e33497ba-5b46-37be-a82d-34bf2ae4e9ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Somehow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa940a9d-4e47-4c70-b2ec-b36f09e379ca",
                                                "sense_id": "3b860af1-3eab-3d2b-9aa5-79b60c2194ce",
                                                "text": "Disinclined to read, and slowly pacing the drawing-room, Lord Meersbrook, after looking earnestly at two small pictures, by old masters, which had someway escaped from their brethren, which were heirlooms at Granard Park, he at length began to examine the works of ingenuity which adorned the mantel;..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "926d0985-d053-4c0d-8e29-7d7f6cb0a45d",
                                                "sense_id": "3b860af1-3eab-3d2b-9aa5-79b60c2194ce",
                                                "text": "By some strange arts Isabel's wonderful story might have been, someway, and for some cause, forged for her, in her childhood, and craftily impressed upon her youthful mind; which so — like a slight mark in a young tree — had now enlargingly grown with her growth, till it had become this immense staring marvel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c065207-2475-48b3-ba86-fb9daa7f9fa4",
                                                "sense_id": "3b860af1-3eab-3d2b-9aa5-79b60c2194ce",
                                                "text": "Robert spoke of his intention to go to Mexico in the autumn, where fortune awaited him. He was always intending to go to Mexico, but someway never got there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c42e383b-1a0c-4e54-9a4e-0eefdba764d7",
                        "source_entry_id": "de350c9b-4a49-3a1d-b305-ba581155aeca",
                        "source_sense_id": "f53d6f4c-4d41-3815-b7fa-95cfb0d3cc07",
                        "target_lang_word": "somehow",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "somehow",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                        "entry_id": "448fe6cd-6495-3885-b703-2a6cb503bdb1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In one way or another; in a way not yet known or explained; by some means"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa0d352b-fc72-42c6-90e6-e8f3501ecdc5",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "This problem has to be tackled somehow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8fc5827-9888-44ef-83f9-b1340df02b9d",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "We don't know how he's still alive after the accident, but somehow he is."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "992fb67a-8ef6-4beb-a78a-6be18e16561c",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "December 1, 2016, Tom Donaghy writing in The New York Times, Tender Side of Edward Albee\nIt’s not by accident Edward wrote “The Goat,” “The Zoo Story” or “Seascape,” with its two lizards, Sarah and Leslie. In fact, in all of his plays the animal is pretty prominent, somehow or other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6b4a762-3f1a-414c-95d3-c517067adcde",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "Carried somehow, somewhither, for some reason, on these surging floods, were these travelers, of errand not wholly obvious to their fellows, yet of such sort as to call into query alike the nature of their errand and their own relations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24029f4c-0e28-435d-8548-359cabb7776b",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "Have I not loathed to live again and said\nIt would have been far better to be dead,\n And yet somehow, I know not why,\nRemained afraid to die!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4254fed-dfb7-46a8-adb2-034937886b68",
                                                "sense_id": "70030fe2-0143-3b3c-84a5-b811c0d303d1",
                                                "text": "Although youngest of the family, he has somehow or other got the entire management of all the others."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "02124f5f-af0a-42a9-a5c7-25cbc32ccdab",
                        "source_entry_id": "de350c9b-4a49-3a1d-b305-ba581155aeca",
                        "source_sense_id": "f53d6f4c-4d41-3815-b7fa-95cfb0d3cc07",
                        "target_lang_word": "ein bißchen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "08a5c0a0-2bce-4702-9164-8842ff9c2963",
                        "source_entry_id": "de350c9b-4a49-3a1d-b305-ba581155aeca",
                        "source_sense_id": "f53d6f4c-4d41-3815-b7fa-95cfb0d3cc07",
                        "target_lang_word": "petit peu",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c77466f2-b4ab-456f-90ba-834ebd72db20",
                        "source_entry_id": "de350c9b-4a49-3a1d-b305-ba581155aeca",
                        "source_sense_id": "f53d6f4c-4d41-3815-b7fa-95cfb0d3cc07",
                        "target_lang_word": "quelque peu",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quelque peu",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56d0f474-335e-3d41-a307-5a6d2d7cd465",
                                        "entry_id": "955bfa0f-2099-31df-a034-6afa2112512e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Un peu."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d54f4c00-360a-4010-9563-c8fe70b64e58",
                                                "sense_id": "56d0f474-335e-3d41-a307-5a6d2d7cd465",
                                                "text": "L’expérience montre que la bourgeoisie se laisse facilement dépouiller, pourvu qu'on la presse quelque peu et qu'on lui fasse peur de la révolution : […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b53d4127-791a-4b0b-9283-a1e80b100ab5",
                                                "sense_id": "56d0f474-335e-3d41-a307-5a6d2d7cd465",
                                                "text": "En réalité, ce vin du Caucase, quelque peu aigrelet, accompagne convenablement la poule bouillie, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a1c2fc-6702-4d57-8c97-ec4015255c54",
                                                "sense_id": "56d0f474-335e-3d41-a307-5a6d2d7cd465",
                                                "text": "Pourtant, comme le train venait de dépasser Bréauté et qu’il ralentissait quelque peu — ce qui mettait sa vitesse à trente kilomètres à l’heure pour le moins, — il feignit de pénétrer au lavabo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbee23c2-099e-4c9a-a60f-8d209225a62f",
                                                "sense_id": "56d0f474-335e-3d41-a307-5a6d2d7cd465",
                                                "text": "Il n'est plus permis aujourd'hui à un photographe quelque peu averti, d'ignorer la sensitométrie. Les méthodes de mesures créées par Hürter et Driffield, perfectionnées par un grand nombre de savants, ont acquis une importance considérable en photographie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a4fd467-7b69-4468-b727-5e6963088718",
                                                "sense_id": "56d0f474-335e-3d41-a307-5a6d2d7cd465",
                                                "text": "D'un seul coup, brutalement, le flotteur gauche s'engagea. Je fus emmené dans un « cheval de bois » à gauche, que je pus contrecarrer quelque peu en accélérant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5000d58-4ab2-348f-8e23-0c0aca82d621",
                                        "entry_id": "955bfa0f-2099-31df-a034-6afa2112512e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Un peu de."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Avec de"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea0c90e4-443c-4ebe-b09f-8d5855d427a8",
                                                "sense_id": "f5000d58-4ab2-348f-8e23-0c0aca82d621",
                                                "text": "Le malheureux Rat résista quelque peu de temps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "108faedb-ca5e-49d4-8311-ee024a8118ec",
                                                "sense_id": "f5000d58-4ab2-348f-8e23-0c0aca82d621",
                                                "text": "Abstenez-vous de tout aliment jusqu’à nouvel avis, je vais faire l’impossible pour vous faire parvenir quelque peu de chocolat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f90ac7a-eddf-3a84-94a1-1f1948081e45",
                                        "entry_id": "955bfa0f-2099-31df-a034-6afa2112512e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beaucoup ; très."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Plus rare",
                                            "Par antiphrase"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c39f7ca0-2dc3-48e3-a55a-81f13ecec312",
                                                "sense_id": "4f90ac7a-eddf-3a84-94a1-1f1948081e45",
                                                "text": "« Oh bien alors ! […], c'est comme si vous promettiez de devenir bientôt un des nôtres. Je suis d'ores et déjà certaine de votre conversion. »\n« D'ici là murmurai-je in petto, il passera encore quelque peu d'eau sous le Pont-Neuf ! »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c310ed73-c423-4bf7-b650-286e538cb97e",
                                                "sense_id": "4f90ac7a-eddf-3a84-94a1-1f1948081e45",
                                                "text": "Ce message rabat-joie fut hué par une partie de la foule mais tempéra quelque peu l'enthousiasme général."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5382b288-f8b8-4398-beca-29b28154899d",
                                                "sense_id": "4f90ac7a-eddf-3a84-94a1-1f1948081e45",
                                                "text": "En ce siècle romantique, le grand public aussi bien que les scientifiques développent une nomenclature quelque peu chromatique des grandes épidémies : ainsi appelle-t-on la tuberculose « mort blanche » ou « peste blanche »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0816eedf-b16d-4e9c-a6c0-46d7d2696c31",
                        "source_entry_id": "de350c9b-4a49-3a1d-b305-ba581155aeca",
                        "source_sense_id": "f53d6f4c-4d41-3815-b7fa-95cfb0d3cc07",
